# Source-grounded exercise recipe: Wave I, Release and Recharge. The transcript
# explicitly calls for orientation, the standard preparatory process and Focus
# 10 before the fear/emotion/memory cycle. Its closing health statement is the
# separate health-affirmation segment, but it belongs to this same tape.
#
# The source finally asks the listener to use the newly learned one-count waking
# return. This recipe keeps the full authored waking count as a safety adaptation:
# the session must not leave a new listener at Focus 10 if that anchor is not yet
# reliable. No unrelated Clear Skies or open exploration hold is added.

@title    Release and Recharge
@level    F10
@ending   return
@pan      right
@seed     10104
@verbosity 3

surf 0.55
use orientation

surf 0.30
use conversion-box
use affirmation

surf 0.18
use resonant-tuning
use balloon

surf 0.0
use relax-10
use release-and-recharge
use health-affirmation

use return
